  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="9a091642-bfea-50a2-b95a-d114dc635479" activityNameId="fbd414b7-92b4-5c90-9000-92a31f791b44" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Cobalt, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Cobalt, at plant
The functional unit represent 1 kg of cobalt. Large uncertainty of the process data due to weak data on the production process.;
CAS number: 007440-48-4; 
Formula: Co; 
UUID: 61b7f557-bf8a-3a2e-8ff9-3f886bf9eaee
Raw materials, land-use, auxillaries and energy consumption as well as emissions to air and water for extraction step. Auxillaries and energy consumption estimated for further treatment step. No emissions for further treatment taken into account. Overburden and tailing material from process together with losses of product not taken into account.
Location: Data represent a global average.
Technology: Data approximated with data from nickel mining and benefication. For the further treatment the process "reduction of oxides" is approximated by stoechiometric calculation - assuming a yield of 95% - and approximations for energy consumption from other chemical plants. No emissions are assumed for this treatment process. 
Time period: undefined
Production volume: worldwide 40 kt in 2001
Sampling: approximation with data from literature 
Extrapolations: see technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_61b7f557-bf8a-3a2e-8ff9-3f886bf9eaee.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="f4808887-5a57-5892-975e-ba0565a93e23" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
